italy/serie-a/\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Serie A\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/events/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex text-xs font-normal underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"All events\\\"}]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><title>Odds Comparison &amp; Today&#x27;s Football Betting Odds | OddsPortal</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Compare betting odds from 80+ bookmakers on today&#x27;s football matches and 30+ sports. Track next matches, dropping odds and value bets on OddsPortal.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"LiveSport s.r.o.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"odds comparison, odds, oddsportal, prizes, compare odds, UK odds, sports, betting, soccer, football, hockey, basketball, bet online\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\"/><meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(c) LiveSport s.r.o. 2007 - 2026\"/><meta name=\"verify-v1\" content=\"Bb7e33T56Ylh3AuhM08L41r1bjNsdEchyFEqQPnK2wg=\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.oddsportal.com/\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" hrefLang=\"en\" href=\"https://www.oddsportal.com/\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" hrefLang=\"pl-pl\" href=\"https://www.oddsportal.com/pl/\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" hrefLang=\"pt-br\" href=\"https://www.oddsagora.com.br/\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" hrefLang=\"it-it\" href=\"https://www.centroquote.it/\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" hrefLang=\"es\" href=\"https://www.cuotasahora.com/\"/><div hidden id=\"S:11\"><div class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"order-2 z-20 m-2 flex self-start border border-gray-light px-[10px] py-[5px] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-3 text-[#FF9800] min-mm:hover:bg-orange-main min-mm:hover:text-white-main\">Show more</button><div class=\"order-1 cms_homepage relative flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-col pt-5 font-main text-xs text-black-main [&amp;_a]:text-[#3598db] [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_h1]:pb-2.5 [&amp;_h1]:font-secondary [&amp;_h1]:text-[28px] [&amp;_h1]:font-semibold [&amp;_h1]:leading-[34px] [&amp;_h1]:text-black-main [&amp;_h2]:pb-2.5 [&amp;_h2]:pt-2.5 [&amp;_h2]:font-secondary [&amp;_h2]:text-[19px] [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:leading-7 [&amp;_h2]:text-black-main [&amp;_h3]:flex [&amp;_h3]:items-center [&amp;_h3]:gap-1 [&amp;_h3]:pb-1.5 [&amp;_h3_span]:flex [&amp;_h3_span]:items-center [&amp;_h3_span]:gap-1 [&amp;_li]:ml-3.5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_p]:pb-2 [&amp;_ul]:flex [&amp;_ul]:gap-1 [&amp;_ul]:text-[#3598db] [&amp;_ul:last-of-type]:block [&amp;_ul:last-of-type]:text-[#3598db] cms_homepage_en after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:z-10 after:mb-2 after:h-36 after:w-full after:bg-gradient-to-t after:from-white-main after:via-white-main/90 after:to-transparent after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]\"><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal - Your Source for Betting Odds and Odds Comparison</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal is your go-to platform for comparing betting odds from leading bookmakers. Whether you're betting on local leagues or international tournaments, our website helps you find the top odds to increase your chances of winning.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Your ultimate source for live odds, betting markets, and real-time comparison of odds from top bookmakers worldwide</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">We provide the latest odds across a wide variety of sports and markets. Whether you're a seasoned bettor or new to sports betting, our odds comparison tool helps you make informed decisions and secure the best possible returns.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Why Use OddsPortal?</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal gives you all that you could need for an enhanced betting experience, and to ensure that you receive the biggest payouts possible on your bets.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Primarily, you will get the best sports betting odds from our recommended online bookmakers, and this can be enjoyed across multiple sports and markets, pre-match and in-play, while you can also appreciate the convenience of the tools through your mobile device.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Get the Best Betting Odds</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">First and foremost, we guarantee that you get the best betting odds for whichever sport or market you are looking to bet on. Ranging from betting on the top divisions to smaller leagues or events, you will find sports betting odds for all types of tournaments.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Thanks to odds comparisons from the best online bookmakers, we ensure that players are getting the best betting odds, which will result in a bigger payout if their bet is to win.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Compare Odds Across Multiple Bookmakers</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> Whichever region you are playing from, there are multiple bookmakers with odds for each of the sporting events and the betting markets available on our site. This means that you can compare odds across several bookmakers to get the best betting odds for single bets, or combinations.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">With the real-time odds comparison we have on offer, you can quickly find the best betting odds for the sports and specific event or events you are interested in wagering on, whether they are in-play or yet to start.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Access to Multiple Sports &amp; Betting Markets</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">There are 20 sports available for you to choose from to find odds comparisons on OddsPortal, with numerous markets available for each of them, including both individual matches and outrights.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Betting markets and odds comparison can be found for all of the most well-known sports like <a href=\"../../../football/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">football</a></span>, <a href=\"../../../tennis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tennis</a> and <a href=\"../../../basketball/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">basketball</a>, but also for more niche sports like Aussie rules, futsal, and more.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Stay Updated with Live Scores and Results</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In addition to pre-match markets being available, you can also find live odds and keep up to date with live scores in your favourite leagues or tournaments.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our fast real time data provides you with live scores immediately after a goal is scored, point is won, or basket is scored. Having all of this information at your fingertips, and <a href=\"../../../inplay-odds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">live odds</a></span> available for matches in-play, enables you to alter your pre-match bets with the best odds available, or lock in some value during a match.</p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our results and standings pages allow you to keep track of competitions on a match by match basis, and how they are performing over the season.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Mobile-Friendly</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You can explore and enjoy odds comparison on your mobile device, allowing you to place wagers with the best betting odds from anywhere. Whether you are at home or on the go, our dynamic, live odds are available on OddsPortal both pre-match and in-play.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Moreover, to ensure you are placing your bets with all the information you need, we have mobile-friendly results and standings pages that give you a better indication of previous form for teams or players.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Elevate Your Sports Betting Game With Oddsportal&rsquo;s Betting Tools</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal has a number of betting tips and tools that might help bring attention to some interesting markets you may have never thought about betting on before, ensuring to bring you the best betting odds as always.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\" alt=\"Dropping Odds\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Dropping Odds</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The <a href=\"../../../dropping-odds/#overall\">dropping odds</a> page demonstrates when a team, player, or market&rsquo;s odds have dropped before the start of a match. This will provide you better visibility about when an online bookmaker might be reducing odds due to circumstances only they are aware of ahead of a match, essentially giving you some betting tips.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You can also filter the page to see dropping odds from the last hour, 12 hours, or 24 hours, the percentage of bookies who have dropping odds, and a particular market you might be interested in betting on.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/08Qh0WfSnYr8Z0AeCMF51fUlsgyd5stVInkDIUhq.png\" alt=\"Value Bets\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Value Bets</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">If you are looking strictly for value and a way to get ahead of the bookmakers, the <a href=\"../../../value-bets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">value bets</a></span> page provides you with some bets with mathematically calculated value. The odds of a bookmaker are compared with the total average odds of the same outcome to illustrate markets with unique value, and probability also included.</p><h3><img style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\" src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\" alt=\"Sure Bets\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Sure Bets</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our <a href=\"../../../sure-bets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sure bets</a></span> page is exactly what you would imagine, a way for you to win guaranteed profit, or sure money, by betting on two different outcomes. You can see the calculated stakes for each outcome by entering how much you want to wager in total, and the profit you will make.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/WQlWmJ6kTsUyAjfwLbyiKiGwS5fMoLYRAugp4tqL.png\" alt=\"Blocked Odds\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /></span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Blocked Odds</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">On the <a href=\"../../../blocked/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blocked odds</a></span> page, you will be able to see matches or markets that online bookmakers are no longer providing odds for, which you can use to your advantage with betting sites that have yet to remove odds or notice changes in the market.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/xt374s6nIbO0Z7dT7tCZKs9kplUOCR395bl0tGDT.png\" alt=\"Bet Calculator\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Bet Calculator</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Perfect for those of you who are new to sports betting, our <a href=\"../../../bet-calculator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bet calculator</a></span> will demonstrate the payout of your bet if you are unsure of how sports betting odds work. This could be for a simple single bet, accumulator, and by decimal, fractional, or American odds depending on your preference.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/KqEkFWX3XG4WQ8gTwsbw49Cm2BaiZLqV0zGgtRMC.png\" alt=\"Results\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Results</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A great betting tool is to check back on archived <a href=\"../../../results/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">results</a></span> for the teams or players involved in the match you are looking to bet on, and we offer that across all of the leagues and tournaments worldwide. The best betting odds are provided for those results too, indicating who might be of value heading into their next match based on recent form.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/JzTQidm3xXFsMh2k1VA6xRosVvb4BZagq0SssNOF.png\" alt=\"Standings\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Standings</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">We have all of the <a href=\"../../../standings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">standings</a></span> available for you in one place for all of the football leagues worldwide, both the top leagues and even the small, local leagues.</p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Head to our standings page to pick out the league you are interested in and see how the table currently looks, with you also being able to filter to see home form, away form, and over a specific amount of matches.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Wide Range of Sports &amp; Leagues Available for Betting</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Whichever sport you are looking to bet on, OddsPortal has an extensive list of markets and odds available for each of them. Providing odds comparisons for the biggest and smallest leagues and tournaments in the world, you can bet with better knowledge and using the best odds from our recommended online bookmakers.</span></p></div></div></div><script>$RC(\"B:11\",\"S:11\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:9\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:9\",\"S:9\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:1\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:1\",\"S:1\")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"9a:I[944520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3_faonkpnif-a.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0qal4luc1-ona.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0x0ps82tzzera.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h9izan-bqvt1.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1emz9mq3jem1q.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3pzoes1x92xo3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0li_offttbsjl.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2vk2x12v5b2g8.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1jacg7fhtmm0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1iu8y13vc_ovu.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4288q2adoxdqa.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9b:T6afd,\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOddsPortal - Your Source for Betting Odds and Odds Comparison\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOddsPortal is your go-to platform for comparing betting odds from leading bookmakers. Whether you're betting on local leagues or international tournaments, our website helps you find the top odds to increase your chances of winning.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eYour ultimate source for live odds, betting markets, and real-time comparison of odds from top bookmakers worldwide\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWe provide the latest odds across a wide variety of sports and markets. Whether you're a seasoned bettor or new to sports betting, our odds comparison tool helps you make informed decisions and secure the best possible returns.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWhy Use OddsPortal?\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOddsPortal gives you all that you could need for an enhanced betting experience, and to ensure that you receive the biggest payouts possible on your bets.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003ePrimarily, you will get the best sports betting odds from our recommended online bookmakers, and this can be enjoyed across multiple sports and markets, pre-match and in-play, while you can also appreciate the convenience of the tools through your mobile device.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eGet the Best Betting Odds\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eFirst and foremost, we guarantee that you get the best betting odds for whichever sport or market you are looking to bet on. Ranging from betting on the top divisions to smaller leagues or events, you will find sports betting odds for all types of tournaments.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eThanks to odds comparisons from the best online bookmakers, we ensure that players are getting the best betting odds, which will result in a bigger payout if their bet is to win.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCompare Odds Across Multiple Bookmakers\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e Whichever region you are playing from, there are multiple bookmakers with odds for each of the sporting events and the betting markets available on our site. This means that you can compare odds across several bookmakers to get the best betting odds for single bets, or combinations.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWith the real-time odds comparison we have on offer, you can quickly find the best betting odds for the sports and specific event or events you are interested in wagering on, whether they are in-play or yet to start.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAccess to Multiple Sports \\u0026amp; Betting Markets\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eThere are 20 sports available for you to choose from to find odds comparisons on OddsPortal, with numerous markets available for each of them, including both individual matches and outrights.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eBetting markets and odds comparison can be found for all of the most well-known sports like \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003efootball\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../tennis/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003etennis\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../basketball/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003ebasketball\\u003c/a\\u003e, but also for more niche sports like Aussie rules, futsal, and more.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eStay Updated with Live Scores and Results\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eIn addition to pre-match markets being available, you can also find live odds and keep up to date with live scores in your favourite leagues or tournaments.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOur fast real time data provides you with live scores immediately after a goal is scored, point is won, or basket is scored. Having all of this information at your fingertips, and \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../inplay-odds/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003elive odds\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e available for matches in-play, enables you to alter your pre-match bets with the best odds available, or lock in some value during a match.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOur results and standings pages allow you to keep track of competitions on a match by match basis, and how they are performing over the season.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMobile-Friendly\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eYou can explore and enjoy odds comparison on your mobile device, allowing you to place wagers with the best betting odds from anywhere. Whether you are at home or on the go, our dynamic, live odds are available on OddsPortal both pre-match and in-play.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eMoreover, to ensure you are placing your bets with all the information you need, we have mobile-friendly results and standings pages that give you a better indication of previous form for teams or players.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eElevate Your Sports Betting Game With Oddsportal\\u0026rsquo;s Betting Tools\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOddsPortal has a number of betting tips and tools that might help bring attention to some interesting markets you may have never thought about betting on before, ensuring to bring you the best betting odds as always.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\\\" alt=\\\"Dropping Odds\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eDropping Odds\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eThe \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../dropping-odds/#overall\\\"\\u003edropping odds\\u003c/a\\u003e page demonstrates when a team, player, or market\\u0026rsquo;s odds have dropped before the start of a match. This will provide you better visibility about when an online bookmaker might be reducing odds due to circumstances only they are aware of ahead of a match, essentially giving you some betting tips.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eYou can also filter the page to see dropping odds from the last hour, 12 hours, or 24 hours, the percentage of bookies who have dropping odds, and a particular market you might be interested in betting on.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/08Qh0WfSnYr8Z0AeCMF51fUlsgyd5stVInkDIUhq.png\\\" alt=\\\"Value Bets\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eValue Bets\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eIf you are looking strictly for value and a way to get ahead of the bookmakers, the \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../value-bets/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003evalue bets\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e page provides you with some bets with mathematically calculated value. The odds of a bookmaker are compared with the total average odds of the same outcome to illustrate markets with unique value, and probability also included.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cimg style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\" src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sure Bets\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eSure Bets\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOur \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../sure-bets/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003esure bets\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e page is exactly what you would imagine, a way for you to win guaranteed profit, or sure money, by betting on two different outcomes. You can see the calculated stakes for each outcome by entering how much you want to wager in total, and the profit you will make.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/WQlWmJ6kTsUyAjfwLbyiKiGwS5fMoLYRAugp4tqL.png\\\" alt=\\\"Blocked Odds\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eBlocked Odds\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOn the \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../blocked/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eblocked odds\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e page, you will be able to see matches or markets that online bookmakers are no longer providing odds for, which you can use to your advantage with betting sites that have yet to remove odds or notice changes in the market.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/xt374s6nIbO0Z7dT7tCZKs9kplUOCR395bl0tGDT.png\\\" alt=\\\"Bet Calculator\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eBet Calculator\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003ePerfect for those of you who are new to sports betting, our \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../bet-calculator/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003ebet calculator\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e will demonstrate the payout of your bet if you are unsure of how sports betting odds work. This could be for a simple single bet, accumulator, and by decimal, fractional, or American odds depending on your preference.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/KqEkFWX3XG4WQ8gTwsbw49Cm2BaiZLqV0zGgtRMC.png\\\" alt=\\\"Results\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eResults\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eA great betting tool is to check back on archived \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../results/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eresults\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e for the teams or players involved in the match you are looking to bet on, and we offer that across all of the leagues and tournaments worldwide. The best betting odds are provided for those results too, indicating who might be of value heading into their next match based on recent form.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/JzTQidm3xXFsMh2k1VA6xRosVvb4BZagq0SssNOF.png\\\" alt=\\\"Standings\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eStandings\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWe have all of the \\u003ca href=\\\"../../../standings/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003estandings\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e available for you in one place for all of the football leagues worldwide, both the top leagues and even the small, local leagues.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eHead to our standings page to pick out the league you are interested in and see how the table currently looks, with you also being able to filter to see home form, away form, and over a specific amount of matches.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWide Range of Sports \\u0026amp; Leagues Available for Betting\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eWhichever sport you are looking to bet on, OddsPortal has an extensive list of markets and odds available for each of them. Providing odds comparisons for the biggest and smallest leagues and tournaments in the world, you can bet with better knowledge and using the best odds from our recommended online bookmakers.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e[[ShowMore]]\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/6NJoKdw3ZKVQMHXbUCG2DGrYasWukjB6zHbe26qu.png\\\" alt=\\\"Football Odds\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003cstrong\\u003eFootball Odds\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eRegardless of which league you are interested in, OddsPortal has football betting odds for anything that you are looking for. Providing a detailed perspective on each individual match with H2H, predictions, and match facts, while you can also find detailed standings, form and results for each league worldwide, you have everything you could require for an enhanced betting experience on football.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eDevelop an understanding of what other users are predicting for football matches in our match detail, while our stat based match facts can help you consider the form and trends for certain teams.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eOdds can be found for all of the upcoming matches and outrights for the top leagues and tournaments such as:\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/england/premier-league/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003ePremier League \\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/germany/bundesliga/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eBundesliga\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/spain/laliga/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eLa Liga\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/italy/serie-a/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eSerie A\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/france/ligue-1/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eLigue 1\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../football/europe/champions-league/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eChampions League\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eFor all in-play matches on football, you can see live score updates with the real-time date available on the live odds page, providing odds comparisons for all matches worldwide as the goals fly in.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/hqxehTdExlvLn6pggIYg1ZbMoslaGXi7tPBj4KDp.png\\\" alt=\\\"Basketball Odds\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" /\\u003e \\u003cstrong\\u003eBasketball Odds\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eVastly improve your betting experience on basketball with OddsPortal by finding the best odds for all individual matches and outrights, as well as being able to discover all of the recent results and odds in which teams won or lost at.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003eSports betting odds and betting markets are available on our site for all of the basketball tournaments worldwide, including:\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../basketball/usa/nba/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eNBA\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../basketball/turkey/super-lig/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eSuper Lig\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"../../../basketball/france/lnb/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u